# ---------------------------------------------------------------- CONFIDENTIAL
# The assessment set (question papers AND answer keys) is confidential.
# It is distributed via Google Drive and the LMS only, and must NEVER be
# committed to a public repository. The trailing-space variant is covered
# because the house folder name sometimes carries one.
/assessment/
/assessment\ /
assessment/
*Answer to *
*Answer Key*

# Internal Drive links + course ids resolved by /gdrive-push — a credential.
.env
.env.*
.claude/lms_tms_api_key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- reference
# Source material this courseware was derived from (the superseded v14 master
# deck, the Skills Framework PDF) — third-party material, not ours to
# republish. Unanchored so it matches at any depth...
**/reference/
# ...but the courseware-build/wsq-slides skills ship a REFERENCE IMPLEMENTATION
# under .claude/skills/**/reference/ that the build actually runs. Keep it.
!.claude/skills/**/reference/
!.claude/skills/**/reference/**

